:''Not to be confused with the ability [[:Category:Cats with Wave Immunity|Immune to Waves]] or the [[Talents|Talent]] [[:Category:Resist Wave Cats|Resist Wave]].''

These cats have an [[Special Abilities|ability]] called Wave Shield. Not only do they take no damage from [[Wave Attack]]s, but they also absorb them, protecting units around and behind them from damage as well. 
